	LEGAL-NOTICE TEMPLATE

	Before publishing:
	- Replace "Not yet received" when the W-IdNr. has been assigned.
	- Do not publish the personal tax number (Steuernummer).
	- This template assumes an unregistered sole proprietorship, no regulated
